## Nits
- Cap: 3 per review. Do not flag formatting the linter already enforces.

## Evidence rules
- Every finding cites `file:line` and a concrete trigger. No guesses from names.
- Tag each finding Important / Nit / Pre-existing.

## Summary format
- Start with the count (e.g. "2 important · 1 nit"). If there is nothing to fix, say "Nothing to fix." plainly.
